From 7aca67ce0253b042d9ce530d14654619386b0f32 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Renato Arantes <renato.arantes@arm.com>
Date: Sun, 9 Aug 2026 19:07:04 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] cpu: aarch64: make jit:uni reorder async compatible

- Guard optional scale pointers.
- Precompute destination scales in order.
- Capture asynchronous work by value.
- Schedule the 0D path asynchronously.
- Read zero points inside async tasks.
- Make compensation reduction async-safe.
---
 src/cpu/aarch64/reorder/jit_uni_reorder.cpp | 178 +++++++++++++-------
 1 file changed, 116 insertions(+), 62 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/cpu/aarch64/reorder/jit_uni_reorder.cpp b/src/cpu/aarch64/reorder/jit_uni_reorder.cpp
index de8a827702..5c41419ef9 100644
--- a/src/cpu/aarch64/reorder/jit_uni_reorder.cpp
+++ b/src/cpu/aarch64/reorder/jit_uni_reorder.cpp
@@ -1,7 +1,7 @@
 /*******************************************************************************
